2604:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Initialize and configure the TIM One Pulse.
2605:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) De-initialize the TIM One Pulse.
