2607:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Stop the TIM One Pulse.
2608:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Start the TIM One Pulse and enable interrupt.
2609:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Stop the TIM One Pulse and disable interrupt.
2610:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Start the TIM One Pulse and enable DMA transfer.
