3009:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
3010:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
3011:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
3012:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init()
3013:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Encoder mode and External clock mode 2 are not compatible and must not be selected toge
3014:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: A call for @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init will erase the settings of @ref HAL_TIM_Config
3015:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         using TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE2 and vice versa
3016:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
3017:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
3018:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
3019:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM Encoder Interface handle
3020:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  sConfig TIM Encoder Interface configuration structure
