7721:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICPolarity The Input Polarity.
7722:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7723:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_RISING
7724:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_FALLING
7725:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICPOLARITY_BOTHEDGE
7726:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7727:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7728:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 4 is selected to be connected to IC4.
7729:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_INDIRECTTI: TIM Input 4 is selected to be connected to IC3.
7730:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_TRC: TIM Input 4 is selected to be connected to TRC.
7731:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICFilter Specifies the Input Capture Filter.
7732:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter must be a value between 0x00 and 0x0F.
7733:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note TIM_ICFilter and TIM_ICPolarity are not used in INDIRECT mode as TI4FP3
7734:HW_Lib/STM32H7/HAL_Lib/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   *       (on channel1 path) is used as the input signal. Therefore CCMR2 must be
